#### Hero visual concept

Create an art-directed visual that communicates coordination, infrastructure, property, logistics, and execution.

Preferred approach: use a refined photographic composition combining architecture, a contemporary commercial or government facility, and a subtle logistics or infrastructure element. Use professional imagery with consistent color grading, strong geometry, and authentic visual detail.

